  "findings": [
    {
      "kind": "OBSERVED_CODE_AND_PROFILE",
      "finding": "Budget.root is the resolved concrete Path returned by local(). Every Budget.check nevertheless calls directory_id -> plain -> Path(path).lstat(). plain invoked Path.__new__ 3645591 times, with 35.001219817 instrumented cumulative seconds on that edge. plain also invoked lstat 3645591 times, with 18.860572744 cumulative seconds on its separate edge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "OBSERVED_CODE_AND_PROFILE",
      "finding": "Budget.check ran 3620010 times, including its current root identity, cancellation, deadline and disk-reserve order. Its directory_id edge ran 3620011 times including constructor capture. These checks are not themselves evidence of redundant authority."
    },
    {
      "kind": "CANDIDATE_NOT_IMPLEMENTED",
      "finding": "A single exact-native-concrete-Path branch in plain could reuse only the already owned lexical object, while the original Path(path) conversion remains for every other type. The subsequent fresh lstat and full link/reparse/type/link-count predicate would stay unchanged. Budget.check would be byte-identical. Hoisted native type identity contains no filesystem metadata."
    },
    {
      "kind": "INDEPENDENT_READ_ONLY_REVIEW",
      "finding": "Progress independently verified the same exact-type requirement against the harness and primary CPython source. isinstance(Path) is insufficient because a hostile subclass may override stat/lstat. The existing Path(path) constructor strips that subclass by constructing the concrete native type."
    },
    {
      "kind": "OBSERVED_PRODUCT_AUTHORITY",
      "finding": "_SearchBudget.stopped wrappers call supplied stateful callbacks; SQLite progress callbacks participate in cancellation. Suppressing callbacks or folding nested cancellation layers changes an observable contract. No such change is proposed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "OBSERVED_PRODUCT_AUTHORITY",
      "finding": "_asset_bytes calls full _retained_source authentication and then source_snapshot. For these small sources, source_snapshot validates _selected, then snapshot invokes its cancellation callback before its own fresh path resolution, named checks and held-file read. Reusing earlier metadata across that callback would not preserve the present mutation boundary."
    },
    {
      "kind": "OBSERVED_PRODUCT_COST",
      "finding": "The retained resolver constructs all supported suffix candidates and tests current ambiguity before full hash verification. Lexical path construction (_paths) accounts for 5.124299594 cumulative instrumented seconds across51252 calls. Any later optimization here must preserve every candidate, ambiguity check, fresh named/held check, full hash and callback; no authority/path-result cache is proposed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "NO_SPEED_PREDICTION",
      "finding": "cProfile instrumentation contributes overhead; cumulative times overlap. These numeric rows do not establish an unprofiled ratio, a guaranteed 3600-second completion or a product throughput gain."
    }
  ],
